    "license": "CC0-1.0 (intended)",
    "notes": "BOO Seattle 2026 (5th edition, Insomniac): Fri Oct 30 + Sat Oct 31, 2026, 5:00 PM-1:30 AM both nights, WaMu Theater, 800 Occidental Ave S, Seattle WA 98134, 18+. Lineup (48 artists, 24 per day) transcribed from the official lineup-by-day page (seattle.boo-halloween.com/lineup/) after the phase-3 announcement (2026-07-30) and cross-checked against JamBase; per-day split is official. Stage assignments are NOT published: the official 'Set Times' page still shows the 2025 schedule (Oct 31/Nov 1 2025, Zedd/Marshmello) as of 2026-09-11, so every start/end is null and every stage is null. Stage names (The Grand Hall, The Bassment, The Corridor) are last year's (2025) three stages; Insomniac's 2026 announcement says 'three stages' but has not named them — update if 2026 names differ. Set times historically drop the week of the event (expect ~Oct 26-29, 2026) on the official set-times page and @boohalloween socials. Venue lat/lon is the US Census geocode of the street address (the address covers the whole Lumen Field complex; the theater is the Event Center building at the south end of the stadium), so approximate. Timezone America/Los_Angeles; both dates are PDT (-420) — DST ends 2:00 AM Sun Nov 1, 2026, after the Saturday session's 1:30 AM close. No official 2026 map yet; map features are stubs. Floor plan v1 (2026-09-13): stylized indoor schematic (see workspace image) drawn from 2025 attendee reports — The Grand Hall (main), The Bassment (bass; moved downstairs in 2025), The Corridor (via merch hallway), plus VIP sections, bars/drink carts, restrooms, free water, rides, chill zone/medical, silent disco. All stage/amenity polygons are null: stage positions inside a building cannot be placed on lat/lon meaningfully, and the venue building footprint was not verified to 6 decimals."
